: Rescue a stalled pipeline","summary":"Honest re-qualification, slippage reviews, and rebuilt forecast credibility.","description":"Honest re-qualification, slippage reviews, and rebuilt forecast credibility.","track":"sales-success","trackLabel":"Sales & Customer Success","trackIcon":"🗺️","gradient":"from-lime-500 via-green-400 to-emerald-300","domain":"playbooks","domainLabel":"Journey Playbooks","level":"journey","minutes":55,"tags":["playbook","journey","sales-success"],"isPlaybook":true},{"slug":"playbook-sales-success-retention-engine","title":"Playbook: Install a retention engine","summary":"Health signals firing interventions months before renewal dates.","description":"Health signals firing interventions months before renewal dates.","track":"sales-success","trackLabel":"Sales & Customer Success","trackIcon":"🗺️","gradient":"from-lime-500 via-green-400 to-emerald-300","domain":"playbooks","domainLabel":"Journey Playbooks","level":"journey","minutes":65,"tags":["playbook","journey","sales-success"],"isPlaybook":true},{"slug":"playbook-data-engineering-warehouse-zero","title":"Playbook: Warehouse from zero to trusted","summary":"Contracted schemas, tested tables, dimensional models analysts rely on.","description":"Contracted schemas, tested tables, dimensional models analysts rely on.","track":"data-engineering","trackLabel":"Data Engineering","trackIcon":"🗺️","gradient":"from-cyan-500 via-teal-500 to-emerald-400","domain":"playbooks","domainLabel":"Journey Playbooks","level":"journey","minutes":75,"tags":["playbook","journey","data-engineering"],"isPlaybook":true},{"slug":"playbook-data-engineering-pipeline-reliability","title":"Playbook: Make pipelines boring again","summary":"Rerunnable stages, freshness SLAs, and alert fatigue eliminated.","description":"Rerunnable stages, freshness SLAs, and alert fatigue eliminated.","track":"data-engineering","trackLabel":"Data Engineering","trackIcon":"🗺️","gradient":"from-cyan-500 via-teal-500 to-emerald-400","doma